          "link": "policy_commitment",
          "basis": "dossier_fact",
          "claim": "Starbucks has authority to implement the capacity reservation in 50 pilot cafés and instrument all 100 stores during January 2027 (d.home.h5).",
          "cite": ["d.home.h5"]
        },
        {
          "link": "capacity_baseline_required",
          "basis": "dossier_fact",
          "claim": "The 20% reservation applies to measured 15-minute peak capacity; no actual measured_capacity_per_15min is in the record, so the effective slot cap cannot be computed this move. The instrumentation action (m1.home.a2) is the mechanism to collect it (d.home.h8).",
