          "link": "dunkin_bundle_launch",
          "basis": "dossier_fact",
          "claim": "Dunkin launches a $6 Meal Deal via app at 15 consenting franchise locations, supported by a local marketing campaign. The $6 price point is evidenced by a September 2026 campaign (d.dunkin.k4), though January 2027 franchise participation and that exact price are assumed rather than confirmed. Combined spend cap of $20,000 is binding (d.dunkin.k5, d.dunkin.k6).",
          "cite": ["d.dunkin.k4", "d.dunkin.k5", "d.dunkin.k6"]
        },
        {
          "link": "dunkin_economics_monitoring",
          "basis": "dossier_fact",
          "claim": "Dunkin commits to a one-month economics review with an exit rule if contribution worsens (m1.dunkin.a3). This monitoring action is implemented; whether it triggers adjustment depends on January basket and repeat data not yet available (d.dunkin.k7, d.dunkin.k8).",
