        "description": "Dutch Bros and Dunkin operational responses are implemented within their envelopes. Dutch Bros adds peak labor at 12 shops and prepares a $1 credit offer for Jan 15–31. Dunkin launches the $6 Meal Deal at 15 locations with a $20,000 spend cap and monitoring rule. Neither competitor's incremental contribution, repeat lift, or actual redemption counts can be stated without January transaction data. Public strategy history updated to reflect observable actions.",
